WEBVTT

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.081
Hvala.

00:16:03.667 --> 00:16:05.919
Mnogo vam hvala. Hvala.

00:16:06.545 --> 00:16:08.296
Hvala.

00:16:08.338 --> 00:16:10.382
Helen Volters: Dženet, ostani tu.

00:16:11.591 --> 00:16:13.135
Imam neka pitanja.

00:16:13.176 --> 00:16:15.762
Dženet Vinterson: Znam
da želite na ručak. I ja želim.

00:16:15.804 --> 00:16:16.805
(Smeh)

00:16:16.847 --> 00:16:18.306
HV: Ne. Svi se zaustavite.

00:16:18.348 --> 00:16:20.976
U redu. To je bilo sjajno. Hvala ti.

00:16:22.602 --> 00:16:26.690
Šta misliš kolike su nam
šanse da ćemo opstati?

00:16:27.649 --> 00:16:28.984
DžV: Vidi -

00:16:28.984 --> 00:16:30.027
(Smeh)